      ],
      "text": "Stoneriver mentally pries through the mind of a creature within 60 feet, dealing 10d8 mental damage (DC 29 basic Will save save). Stoneriver can choose to make this damage nonlethal or choose not to damage the creature at all. For 1 minute, Stoneriver gains a +1 circumstance bonus to attack rolls, damage rolls, and Perception checks against that creature. If the creature is evil and it failed its save, the creature is additionally Frightened 2 (Frightened 4 on a critical failure). Stoneriver can't use Measure Soul again for 1d4 rounds."
